<BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout title="Necessary cookies & storage" description="How necessary browser storage supports core dashboard preferences." eyebrow="COOKIE DETAILS">
  <h2>Purpose</h2><p>Necessary storage is limited to supporting the local interface: remembered appearance, selected display preferences, your privacy choice, and imported workspace data in browser storage. This build uses local storage for these functions rather than requiring a login cookie.</p>
  <h2>What it does not do</h2><p>The current preview does not use this storage for advertising, cross-site tracking, analytics profiling or user authentication.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2><p>Stored preferences generally remain until you clear this site's browser data or the application overwrites them. There is no central account or server-side preference record in this prototype.</p>
  <h2>Manage preferences</h2><p>Open <a href="/business-analytics/privacy-settings">Privacy settings</a> to save a necessary-only or reject-optional choice. These controls describe the current demo and must be updated if the implementation changes.</p>
</BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout>
